('creature', 'xiticix-leaper', 'Bite Attack (poisonous)', '3D6', 1, NULL, 'Plus poison: counts as two melee attacks. Against Mega-Damage targets the poison adds 4D6 M.D. and 1D6 M.D. at the start of each new melee round for 1D6 rounds. Against S.D.C. beings the poison does 1D4x100 S.D.C./Hit Points (10% on a successful save vs lethal poison, 14 or higher).', 3),
